835
01:35:31.910 --> 01:35:32.930
Fucking idiot.

836
01:35:33.580 --> 01:35:34.840
Her next-door neighbor?

837
01:35:37.280 --> 01:35:39.180
You're fucking insane.

838
01:35:39.990 --> 01:35:42.610
