886
01:49:15.770 --> 01:49:16.890
Mister!

887
01:49:17.670 --> 01:49:20.500
You came to save me!

888
01:49:20.970 --> 01:49:22.100
Right?

889
01:49:22.910 --> 01:49:24.970
Right. mister?

890
